{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "744e2d44-6c60-899b-97f1-cc17d265d680",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T12:37:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:35:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, this is Hector Mejia. I'm calling for my mother, her landlord left a pile of bulk waste at the curb after a move-out, and I need to know when the next pickup is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "320 Old Beach Road, over on the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's in the pile, just so I know what we're talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A mattress, a couple of chairs, a broken dresser, some bags. It was the tenant upstairs. They moved out Saturday and the landlord just set it all out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:36:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Hang on, let me pull up the route for that street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. [pause] Sorry, I'm in the middle of dinner prep here, I'm trying to stretch a rotisserie chicken into three dinners, so if you hear me chopping, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Okay, so regular trash on Old Beach Road is picked up on Thursday. That would be this coming Thursday, the twelfth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. And does the bulk stuff go with that, or is that separate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk items usually aren't taken with the regular truck. Mattresses and furniture generally need to be scheduled separately. I can put in a request for a bulk pickup at that address if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:37:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and is it the landlord who should be contacted, or you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:37:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Me. Hector Mejia, 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:37:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, I've got that. Someone from the department will call you back to confirm the date. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy that chicken."
    }
  ],
